ReminderCenterChange.description:
提醒中心: open or close it (the computer's bell popover, the phone's 提醒 page) and pick its filter;
a filter alone also opens it. `more` = 继续加载当天提醒 (#932 R5): the next batch of a day past its first
500 reminders, while the snapshot's moreToday says there is one (opens the center too).

get.description:
`since` (本地 K 线缓存, 2026-10-12): the datetime of the last closed bar the reader already holds;
the answer then carries only the bars after it with `barsAfter` and `barsWindow` (see
shared_market.workbench_since). A replay always answers the whole workbench.

The economic calendar (next 1–7 days, China / US / Eurozone, importance ≥ medium), from cache;
status ok / stale (missingDays, staleDays) / loading / unavailable. `product` (SHFE.au or au)
keeps only the events related to that product's category (`otherCount`: the rest).
